  "_note": "ATtiny88 32-pad QFN / 32-lead TQFP electrical package, added for the Blinkenrocket hardware. Package order and ADC functions are from Microchip ATtiny48/88 datasheet doc8008, 32 QFN top view. PA0 and PA1 are bonded out here as ADC6 and ADC7; they do not exist as leads on the PDIP-28 `attiny88` part. The Blinkenrocket MIT hardware schematic connects its modem input to PA0/ADC6, its AT24C64 to PC4/PC5, matrix columns to PB0-PB7, rows to PD0-PD7, and buttons to PC3/PC7. This surface-mount package intentionally has no breadboard footprint."
